<title>USA: No suspect Hudson hamburger bought by U.S. - USDA.</title>
<headline>No suspect Hudson hamburger bought by U.S. - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>None of the hamburger being recalled by Hudson Foods Co was purchased for export or for federal food programs, U.S. Agriculture Department officials said Friday.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day, USDA announced that 1.2 million lbs of hamburger produced by Hudson Foods, based in Rogers, Ark., was being recalled. It was a huge increase in the recall total.</p>
<p>Three USDA officials said none of the hamburger had been purchased for export, for the school lunch program or for the military.</p>
</text>
